        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series Latitude Door Lever Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique design of Schlage's Latitude Lever is perfect for more contemporary homes. Available in 5 finishes, this sleek leverset will blend seamlessly into most modern-style homes. It will fit most standard door preparations and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It is adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" door thicknesses. Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, keyed entry, and storeroom lock functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install Schlage lever, you safeguard your home and family as well as your peace of mind. Schlage Latitude door levers are resistant to tarnishing, discoloration and corrosion.  Plus, the wide variety of finishes may make your decision tough--just like this lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Latitude Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece lever for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</B> of the F-Series Schlage Latitude Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the lever while turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock (Entry by Key Only):</b> Use when entry by a key is needed. Always locked, entry from the outside requires a key. The inside lever is always unlocked. The outside lever is fixed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Latitude Door Lever, Schlage F-LAT",
                "description": "Schalge F-Series Latitude Lever -The unique design of Schlage's Latitude Lever is perfect for more contemporary homes. Available in 5 finishes, this sleek leverset will blend seamlessly into most modern-style homes. It will fit most standard door preparations and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses. Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, keyed entry, and storeroom lock functions.",
